<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Lend Lease in talks over Equitable unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Lend Lease in talks over Equitable unit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and insurance group Lend Lease Corp Ltd is in talks with The Equitable Cos Inc over the purchase of Equitable's U.S. property management unit, Equitable Real Estate Investment Management (ERE), The Australian Financial Review newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The chairman of Lend Lease's property and investment services group, Richard Longes, said yesterday the negotiations had been instigated by listed U.S. life insurer The Equitable Cos,&quot; the newspaper said.</p>
<p>&quot;This is the sort of opportunity we've been looking for,&quot; Longes was quoted as saying.</p>
</text>
